[{"title":"送米与百丈颂","author":"释印肃","text":"百丈孤云入道林，真如不动意难寻。\n道人相见非来往，语默全彰亘古今。\n近日庐陵亲得价，一时分付老婆心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9130,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"香积厨法语","author":"释印肃","text":"咦，好辨心，以此三法为三昧，无量无边世不会。\n我今修供佛众生，万圣千贤悉同共。\n摩诃般若味真如，十波罗蜜同受用。\n大家著力要精专，一粒微尘不许动。\n为报龙天并八部，莫入厨中乾打鬨。\n监斋使者在眼前，守护普庵无罅缝。\n针劄不入起馨香，十八元来佛不共。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9131,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"破屋颂示众","author":"释印肃","text":"一个闲身穿破屋，风吹雨滴转光明。\n灯笼露柱时时举，只道以平报不平。\n琉璃殿上鞭金马，追风不及三脚驴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9132,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"造袁州浮桥语","author":"释印肃","text":"普庵教化修浮桥，信心自肯大丰饶。\n解脱皆因不思议，度人无量永逍遥。\n秀江千古源何极，非干今日与明朝。\n一生补处谁知有，万德咸欢寂体寥。\n蚊子眼中藏刹土，红灯焰里热眉毛。\n毫发虚空全不漏，海山相击浪滔滔。\n石牛吃尽张公粟，木女垂丝钓巨鳌。\n新罗国打西川鼓，东震旦抛北越刀。\n孔自孔，毛自毛，针劄不入大雄豪。\n妄想颠倒苏公盛，未解撑船弄竹篙。\n岂在文言多卜度，德山拄杖不敲槽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9133,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"造塔示众","author":"释印肃","text":"求人不如求自己，自己肯时无不成。\n如今宝塔所将圆，诸人尽发一轮心。\n气急杀人因悟道，灵山会上没闲人。\n大小不拘皆拽石，高低齐转普庵经。\n山林岩谷皆微笑，此是如来最上因。\n若有痴顽拨不转，猪楼羊棬好安身。\n老僧拄杖头有眼，不打披毛戴角伦。\n如是斩钉并截铁，一人了事万缘新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9134,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"铁竹歌","author":"释印肃","text":"普庵和尚铁竹歌，十圣三贤不奈何。\n九节玲珑通法界，不由笾笋自喽啰。\n从百鍊，已经磨，能障狂风止海波。\n恶龙摄毒皆由我，猛虎归降岂是佗。\n世出世间无可比，非凡非圣力摩诃。\n莫耶剑，比天戈，生灭劳形费气多。\n只这一条刚不坏，撑天拄地应三摩。\n身瑩净，意曼陀，非眼耳鼻六通和。\n肉眼那能堪作见，二乘天眼尚誵讹。\n德山老汉却老婆，横竖宗风般若多。\n罕遇其人难措手，至今独卓立巍峨。\n君不见，莫蹉跎，点石为金也是他。\n即栗横肩千万个，解吞铁竹可相过。\n未动口时百杂碎，岂同狐族唱巴歌。\n顺天助道功非细，只欲令人脱死魔。\n喃喃解语非关舌，入水何曾动碧波。\n铁竹自歌如是唱，海潮音彻笑呵呵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9135,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其九 转位也","author":"释印肃","text":"转转，两头不著中心选。\n无位真人是阿谁，佛祖鼻孔穿成串。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9136,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 玄机也","author":"释印肃","text":"玄玄，不用言，机锋相拄箭头连。\n达道无机玄不满，儱侗真如有万千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9137,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 祖意也","author":"释印肃","text":"祖祖，如钟鼓，未击有意周天普。\n虚幻形声本自无，如如不动亘今古。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9138,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 回机也","author":"释印肃","text":"回回，目击心通处处开。\n机深体浅无人会，满天风道我如来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9139,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 还源也","author":"释印肃","text":"还还，不消下水及登山。\n左右逢源名实相，从斯周匝卧云闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9140,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 心印也","author":"释印肃","text":"心心，非不心，未得印时生死侵。\n除非一搭无纤翳，六道皆标我相形。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9141,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 达本也","author":"释印肃","text":"达达，遍满河沙微尘刹。\n本来无语似阳春，雨过花枝连夜发。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9142,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 尘异也","author":"释印肃","text":"尘尘，背觉劳生地狱因。\n镜写异形分皂白，合元一性自天真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9143,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 演教也","author":"释印肃","text":"演演，莫执文书案上展。\n教人戒定慧坚牢，知见解脱堂堂显。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9144,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其十 一色也","author":"释印肃","text":"一一，恰似太虚经鸟迹。\n色即是空空不空，度日长吹无孔笛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9145,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 一色","author":"释印肃","text":"鹭鹚立雪非同色，镜里色空谁间隔。\n不是青黄黑白红，上下东西及南北。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9146,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 心印","author":"释印肃","text":"心印何人敢授传，无师弟子佛众生。\n几多妄想成怪觉，执境迷心拜衲僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9147,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 心印","author":"释印肃","text":"问君心印作何颜，影现千潭印万山。\n夜静画楼吹玉管，声声相应绝遮栏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9148,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 心印","author":"释印肃","text":"呼为心印早虚言，满目真如自现前。\n十二时中无不应，金莺频道柳含烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9149,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 心印","author":"释印肃","text":"无心犹隔一重关，滞寂沉空也大难。\n啼问阿娘谁是母，闲云溪水笑潺潺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9150,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 玄机","author":"释印肃","text":"撒手那边千圣外，见知不与凡同会。\n高峰绝顶棹孤舟，海里炉焚烟自在。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9151,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 回机","author":"释印肃","text":"万古碧潭空界月，猿啼彻夜何曾歇。\n几炙孤负一轮光，唯我同辉谁辨别。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9152,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 回机","author":"释印肃","text":"石女天明戴帽归，一身浑著六铢衣。\n喃喃解说非声舌，生得儿来叫阿姨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9153,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 回机","author":"释印肃","text":"却装珍御复名谁，更展琅函耀木辉。\n了道不除□权立，一切元体是无馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9154,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 回机","author":"释印肃","text":"陌路相逢没定期，蛇婆来命怪谁知。\n四十八人成鳖鼻，急唤顽禅草里归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9155,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 回机","author":"释印肃","text":"木人夜半穿靴去，得意生身无住处。\n妙用难传妄想心，知君未解通方句。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9156,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 尘异","author":"释印肃","text":"菩提烦恼等空平，色里胶青用始精。\n盐入水中寻不见，□舌轻点笑欣欣。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9157,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 尘异","author":"释印肃","text":"丈夫自有冲天志，不著形名非与是。\n交彻辉光意气浓，金毛师子真堪畏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9158,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 尘异","author":"释印肃","text":"谁言卞璧无人鉴，但办肯心终不赚。\n燎却眉毛尚不知，询岐欲往西天探。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9159,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 尘异","author":"释印肃","text":"我道骊珠到处晶，包含万有独明灵。\n同光索价遭人问，两手张开帽带陈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9160,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 达本","author":"释印肃","text":"云水隔时君莫住，横吞碧汉包天地。\n任他物变景推迁，独我真如全定慧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9161,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 还源","author":"释印肃","text":"宾主穆时全是妄，相逢迎送分阶巷。\n老胡不识警梁王，宝积摩尼欢喜藏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9162,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 转位","author":"释印肃","text":"镬汤炉炭吹教灭，一日三餐饱便歇。\n狱卒牛头恶夜叉，同气连枝应不别。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9163,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 转位","author":"释印肃","text":"金锁玄关留不住，穿云透石充寰宇。\n四时不语信寥寥，万劫超然希伴侣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9164,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 转位","author":"释印肃","text":"烦恼海中为雨露，穷坑变作珍珠库。\n可怜不识夜明帘，打破画瓶无作做。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9165,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 祖意","author":"释印肃","text":"透网金鳞犹滞水，识神照觉非知己。\n肯心鸟道即菩提，三文买竭庐陵米。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9166,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 祖意","author":"释印肃","text":"祖意如空不是空，鹏程九万力唯风。\n若非风体空何用，体得无空道自通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9167,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 祖意","author":"释印肃","text":"回途石马出纱笼，嘶起寰中雨后风。\n吹散暮云孤月朗，危峦烟寺一声钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9168,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 祖意","author":"释印肃","text":"慇勤为说西来意，得意忘言真不二。\n昨夜三更穿市过，只闻米贱油盐贵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9169,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 祖意","author":"释印肃","text":"莫问西来及与东，焉知佛祖一空同。\n四维上下皆如是，争奈凡愚执相容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9170,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 演教","author":"释印肃","text":"龙宫满藏医方义，药病相当除五味。\n搅草耆婆也大痴，胡言乱拔茎茎是。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9171,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 演教","author":"释印肃","text":"真净界中才一念，未离学地终须欠。\n今生努力绝名言，永劫不遭尘垢玷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9172,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 演教","author":"释印肃","text":"初说有空人尽执，未明理事虚劳力。\n念来年久转迷情，心不负人徒面赤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9173,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂三门 其二","author":"释印肃","text":"此舍绝边无壁落，充虚露地真寥廓。\n往来只道主人宽，争似永嘉一宿觉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9174,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其四","author":"释印肃","text":"不奈何，不奈何，一长三短大誵讹。\n当时不是江西老，一口横吞起碧波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9175,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其九十八","author":"释印肃","text":"赵州火急要人成，大众浑无半眼窥。\n骑个金毛游物外，南泉滴滴意深深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9176,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其九十六","author":"释印肃","text":"无相光中弄影人，形同异类性天真。\n披毛戴角冰和水，削发披衣水合冰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9177,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其九十四","author":"释印肃","text":"三脚驴子弄蹄行，只欲途中拶后生。\n一片丹霞尘不染，包藏万有岂称能。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9178,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其九十一","author":"释印肃","text":"打开兜率露王宫，摩耶夫人没老去。\n净饭国王生太子，字字言言说脱空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9179,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其九十","author":"释印肃","text":"立亡坐脱不为奇，石霜迁化少人知。\n九峰师子连天吼，刹那惊杀野狐狸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9180,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其八十七","author":"释印肃","text":"似水煎茶待故人，知音吃了笑忻忻。\n茶水本来无一说，扬眉早是自瞒心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9181,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其八十四","author":"释印肃","text":"大秤秤不起，小斗量不尽。\n无量劫即今，无不是心印。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9182,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其八十三","author":"释印肃","text":"镜含世界几千春，非相非形假立名。\n汩没未尝离镜体，怜生谁合饮光人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9183,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其七十七","author":"释印肃","text":"不识是真识有心，识心遍处不求人。\n江陵米满元无价，师子全威画不成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9184,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其七十五","author":"释印肃","text":"探宗勘辨要当人，劫火燄中摝眼睛。\n渐源顿入洪波里，直至如今不见形。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9185,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其七十三","author":"释印肃","text":"古人投子续宗枝，相逢作者便呈机。\n含光知有庵中主，提起油瓶应不疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9186,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其七十","author":"释印肃","text":"万里草不生，三昧号无诤。\n梦游观玉境，毕竟是谁行。\n在处曼曼地，只道无两般。\n法门非出入，学者莫颟顸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9187,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其六十九","author":"释印肃","text":"难信难闻独眼龙，布云施雨觅无踪。\n却被普贤穿却鼻，如今众信永无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9188,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其六十七","author":"释印肃","text":"信地无闲处，知心用不非。\n微尘佛国土，妙在一毫釐。\n应当如是见，所说但随宜。\n古锥无做作，谩把布毛吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9189,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其六十六","author":"释印肃","text":"没眼休谈见药山，免将明暗警盲参。\n特牛生子犹为易，石女生儿岂似凡。\n孤明独朗光无二，只恐痴猿搅碧潭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9190,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其六十五","author":"释印肃","text":"孤舟不系弄华亭，无限风光意气清。\n善会不干于耳目，岂容声色付元灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9191,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其六十一","author":"释印肃","text":"觌面相呈也大奇，更无分别与迟疑。\n自从收得非离合，岂可虚明放过伊。\n精金百鍊方为贵，脱体灵明绝见知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9192,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其六十","author":"释印肃","text":"见道不生机，生机不见道。\n青峰年年青，白水常浩浩。\n生熟路不通，迷悟俱不到。\n青白未萌前，乐普大深奥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9193,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其五十九","author":"释印肃","text":"云无踪兮雨无迹，事理绵绵有何极。\n卖金须是买金人，这里若真不相识。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9194,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其五十八","author":"释印肃","text":"察明表重验虚无，不久堪为唱导师。\n不觉惊动生灭相，临时撮略显精粗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9195,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其五十七","author":"释印肃","text":"三圣戴角虎，德山独眼龙。\n未展机先合，非言意已通。\n风云融万象，笑哭是谁同。\n死中若不活，争免被他笼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9196,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其五十六","author":"释印肃","text":"心藏智宝少知音，全机付与水龙吟。\n忽然撞著无相似，谁解光和活死人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9197,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其五十四","author":"释印肃","text":"关南老婆横木剑，不露锋铓大灵验。\n掷下威光绝见闻，丰城独卓无馀欠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9198,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其五十二","author":"释印肃","text":"循水寻流不见源，逢人相问岂堪言。\n知君背觉劳生解，谩语皆真意普贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9199,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其五十","author":"释印肃","text":"门外君子至，一切人不会。\n打这闲家具，甘贽与南泉。\n大地扶不起，为甚扶不起，果报还如是。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9200,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其四十八","author":"释印肃","text":"风舞岩松人不会，谩施巧便转惛惶。\n彻夜为伊坚不信，未知何劫肯承当。\n□苍天苍天。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9201,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其四十三","author":"释印肃","text":"百亿化身唯佛知，含生经劫转沉迷。\n空花水月分三界，一念归元也太奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":9202,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]